<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">Mask</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Mask to enable. Bit positions of 1 are enabled. This mask is formed by OR&apos;ing bits from XBRAM_IR* bits which are contained in <ref refid="xbram__hw_8h" kindref="compound">xbram_hw.h</ref>. </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
